ecks, are they not?\r\n\r\nNo they are not, please check the code base if you are going to make some kind of point about this specific case\r\n\r\nI am sorry if the author of this PR felt unwelcome by this, but the way this PR was presented and the contents was a red flag, but that was cleared up\r\n\r\nBut regardless of AI use this specific line of code was strange and either indicated an ignorance of the codebase, or use of AI, or both in combination, and it's important to clear up what is the case. If the code is wrong then that needs to be checked\r\n\r\nSo to @NoNormalDev, if you felt uncomfortable at this or unwelcome I'm very sorry, it was not my intention and the internet and written text is not an optimal medium \r\n\r\nBut @alexfacciorusso you are making a lot of assumptions and accusations based on very little and disrupting a conversation that aims to aid this new contributor in understanding the codebase ","created_at":"2026-04-26T15:05:56Z","updated_at":"2026-04-26T15:05:56Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118964#discussion_r3143676253","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118964","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3143676253"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118964#discussion_r3143676253"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118964"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3143676253/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":73,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3143470195,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":6,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3143685251","pull_request_review_id":4177080188,"id":3143